WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:08.960
Hello there, you've just joined us deep

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.410
in the Amazon Rainforest.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.940
Sweaty.
Very hot.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.540
Uh, we've found...

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.730
some Sony speakers, in
their natural habitat...

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:16.563
Just lying around.

00:00:16.563 --> 00:00:18.040
Which is why we came to the rainforest.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:18.873
What are we doing today?

00:00:18.873 --> 00:00:20.240
Uh, we've got some food today.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:21.073
We're gonna make some,

00:00:21.073 --> 00:00:23.110
using the corn starch we've got.

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:25.390
Found this in the jungle over there.

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.140
Oh, it's getting bright
let me adjust the exposure.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:27.973
You keep going.

00:00:27.973 --> 00:00:29.367
And...

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:31.330
And we also found a Sony Hi-Fi system.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.000
We're gonna hookup the Sony speakers to it

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.315
and hopefully get that whole...

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.400
There's the speaker.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:39.940
Yeah.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:40.773
Get at it!

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:43.270
Just pull the whole top
off... there you go.

00:00:45.393 --> 00:00:47.900
That is a weird feeling!

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:48.733
Isn't that weird?

00:00:48.733 --> 00:00:50.200
Weird! Have you done this before?

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.033
Yeah.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.860
So after many years of filming

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.205
with either very bright
lights or indirect sunlight,

00:00:56.205 --> 00:00:59.000
I've learnt that filming in
slow-mo with the color white

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.470
is an absolute nightmare.

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.740
So now it's not. It's a--

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:04.180
Oh that looks better.
It's red.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:05.939
All right we have to
mix this in really well.

00:01:05.939 --> 00:01:08.073
Ah, that looks weird!

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:11.680
That good?

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:13.600
Yeah.
Yeah?

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:17.700
That's so weird!

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.373
It's not liquid at all, look!

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:22.253
Feels like... ah so strange.

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:27.067
That's me trying to put as
much as I can on my hands.

00:01:28.179 --> 00:01:29.012
It just locks up,

00:01:29.012 --> 00:01:30.933
it's like "no I don't want to leave!"

00:01:32.936 --> 00:01:33.769
Oh man!

00:01:33.769 --> 00:01:34.602
All right that's probably enough.

00:01:34.602 --> 00:01:35.435
You reckon?

00:01:35.435 --> 00:01:36.268
That might be too much actually.

00:01:36.268 --> 00:01:37.268
Okay so...

00:01:38.467 --> 00:01:39.300
Are you ready?

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.467
Yeah, ready.

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:42.143
Go for it!

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:09.767
All right, now stop it!

00:02:11.724 --> 00:02:12.557
So weird, isn't it!

00:02:12.557 --> 00:02:13.660
Yeah, it's really weird!

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:15.530
Like once you set it off it's like...

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:16.671
Oh there you go!

00:02:16.671 --> 00:02:18.331
And then it just collapses
back into liquid afterwards.

00:02:18.331 --> 00:02:19.164
Yeah.

00:03:46.111 --> 00:03:47.290
Well, thanks for watching that video!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.100
Be sure to follow us on Twitter,

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:51.260
take a gander at the
T-shirts, we've got three.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:52.460
Uh, that's about it really...

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:53.520
Subscribe!

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:55.940
My eyebrows are actually
the sweat out from my eyes.

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:57.620
I think that is indeed
the purpose of eyebrows.

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:58.453
Evolution!

00:03:58.453 --> 00:03:59.286
Yeah.

00:03:59.286 --> 00:04:00.730
Right, well I'm gonna get
something from the fridge.

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:02.420
Yeah, uh...

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:03.550
Play some Xbox or something?

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:05.000
Yeah.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.633
Still haven't finished Dead Rising.

